<% content_for :title, "About" %>
<article class="about-page narrow">
  <h1>About Commonbound</h1>
  <p>The age of AI calls for people who chase impact, not promotions. People who chase expertise, not job titles. People who think outside the box, solve problems, and create output that goes far beyond pretty PowerPoints.</p>
  <p>We don’t need companies that exist solely to chase shareholder profits. We want companies that work towards sustainable transformation and prosperity for everyone.</p>
  <p>Somewhere along the way, we unlearned what really matters about work. We started using job titles as milestones. But what do we actually do that makes us proud?</p>
  <p>At Commonbound, we’re changing the conversation around work by looking at both corporate and individual impact.</p>
  <p>We connect people with companies, and companies with each other, to accelerate impact and solve the world’s most pressing problems.</p>
  <p>People at work are bored. Checked out. And AI is here to eliminate many of the jobs we’ve built our working lives around.</p>
  <p>We need to rethink what productive output means. It’s time for people to identify themselves not by their job title, but by what they fight for, the problems they wake up every day to solve, and the impact they create.</p>
  <p>Because that’s how we give sustainable, circular, and regenerative transformation a real chance to happen.</p>
  <p>Regardless of who’s a manager and who’s an executive. Are you ready to join?</p>
